	(text "Fricky frack probably did not need to do all this...\nThis connector is no-good for flex connections, only really valid for board on board,\nunless we design an custom FFC that pairs withe male part of AXT550124.\n\nNext steps are to make DMD board with onboard flex 50-pin standard flex connector\nand interfeace with this board (maybe another PCB interconnect in between dependent\non outcome of design review with Ilya / Sky."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
